        "original_id": "fa73a7ab-d524-5854-894c-9cb0440dcb07",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Morgan Paull, Ridley Scott, Hampton Fancher, David Peoples, Philip K. Dick\n- Works: Blade Runner, Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?, Dirty O'Neil\n- Roles: Dave Holden, Jimmy O'Neil\n- Places: Texas\n\nFacts:\n- Morgan Paull was born on December 15, 1944, and died on July 17, 2012.\n- Philip K. Dick wrote the 1968 novel Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?.\n- Blade Runner was directed by Ridley Scott.\n- Blade Runner was written by Hampton Fancher and David Peoples.\n- Blade Runner is a loose adaptation of Philip K. Dick's 1968 novel Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?.\n- Morgan Paull was an American actor most notable for playing Dave Holden in Blade Runner.\n- In Dirty O'Neil, Morgan Paull plays Jimmy O'Neil, a cop in a small Texas town.\n- In Dirty O'Neil, Jimmy O'Neil is fond of women and is forced into action when three homicidal thugs invade the town.",
